                "reply_count": 120,
                "retweet_count": 549,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While Gov. Shapiro loves to ignore facts (READ:  thinks you\u2019re stupid), let\u2019s set the record straight here. \n\nThe ACA (\u201cObamacare\u201d) was enacted on a partisan basis. We were all told it \u201c\u2026would lower the cost of healthcare and we could keep our plans!\u201d \n\nNothing was further from the truth, but that\u2019s how everyone got sold on it so easily and blindly - which is exactly what the Left (and insurance companies) wanted.  \n\nSince Obamacare\u2019s enactment, the cost of healthcare has SKYROCKETED - while access to family doctors in our neighborhoods has all but disappeared.\n\nMeanwhile, insurance company profits are up 230% (I say again: 230% PROFIT) - and rejection rates hover around 30%.\n\nTo \u201cfix\u201d these problems, Pres. Biden and Congressional Democrats decided to enfeeble our Nation with more debt during the pandemic - and paid insurance companies to stay in business (govt subsidies). \n\nWhen the pandemic ended, insurance companies continue(d) to raise rates while planning to keep getting money from Taxpayers (govt subsidies).  \n\nIt\u2019s time to FIX THIS and make healthcare affordable and accessible - for everyone.  \n\nStop believing the Leftist propaganda.",
